  "nameOrigin": "After Niels Bohr, pioneer of the quantum theory of the atom.",
  "symbolNote": "Proposed as nielsbohrium (Ns); shortened to bohrium (Bh) in 1997. Temporary name: unnilseptium (Uns).",
  "source": "iupac_discovery",
